Create one response section per applicable requirement slot. Cite supported capability evidence and owner-approved future commitment separately. Reconcile quantity, pricing, performance date and technical scope across sections. Label exceptions plainly; leave unsupported material unanswered with a documented disposition rather than generic assurance.
